HezuoBot-Core reuses src/openai-chat-protocol.ts and src/chat-repeat-guard.ts
from HezuoBot's desktop/server/drivers/ without modification.
The independent core conversation loop adapts the structured Chat Completions
request, assistant tool-call replay and tool-result roundtrip of
HezuoBot's desktop/server/drivers/openai-chat.ts. Configuration, CLI entry,
restricted tools and isolated tests are new implementations.
Only the relevant upstream attribution is retained; desktop, gateway, browser,
provider catalogs and their unrelated bundled third-party code are not included.

Browser error category vocabulary is adapted from HezuoBot
desktop/server/browser/cdp/errors.ts, which follows T3 Code
apps/server/src/preview/ServerBrowserPage.ts:
https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code
